  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:36px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/443/937/pixil-frame-0-55.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"321\"></span><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:36px\">在Minecraft中增加寶石螃蟹的模組</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:36px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/443/888/overworld-crabsy.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"563\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/443/887/nether-crabsy.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"281\"><br></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:36px\">更新日誌</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\">更新 v.1.0.2：錯誤修復</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\">更新 v.1.0.3：新增地獄螃蟹</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\">更新 v.1.0.4：錯誤修復，新螃蟹動畫</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\">為 Minecraft 1.16.5 更新：在 Minecraft 1.16.5 版本中加入此模組</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\">更新 v.1.0.5：錯誤修復 - 地獄螃蟹</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\">更新 v.1.0.6：你可以使用任何等級的鎬子右鍵點擊寶石螃蟹，輕鬆獲得礦石；如果鎬子帶有幸運附魔，將獲得更多礦石。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\">更新 v.1.0.7：螃蟹周圍現在有閃光粒子，讓你更容易發現它們，錯誤修復</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\">更新 v.1.0.8：螃蟹變得更難找到。</span></p>\n</div><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:36px\">1.18.2+ 專用模組</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:36px\">僅限 Forge 版本</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:36px\">回報錯誤請留言</span><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:36px\"><br></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\">附加元件</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:36px\">Gobber -&gt;&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gemcrabs-gobber\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gemcrabs-gobber</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:36px\">Undergarden -&gt;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gem-crabs-undergarden\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gem-crabs-undergarden</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://www.lowyat.net/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/Patreon-logo.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"181\" height=\"121\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/praizazdd7724?fan_landing=true\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.patreon.com/praizazdd7724?fan_landing=true</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/praizazdd7724?fan_landing=true\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.patreon.com/praizazdd7724?fan_landing=true\" alt=\"\"></a></span></p>",
